_posset_45932_16x9.jpg 448w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_608/recipes/easy_lemon_posset_45932_16x9.jpg 608w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_832/recipes/easy_lemon_posset_45932_16x9.jpg 832w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/easy_lemon_posset_45932_16x9.jpg 1600w" width="720" height="405" class="ssrcss-egie1y-Image edrdn950"/></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div span="3" data-testid="related-recipe-dish" class="ssrcss-138g5sh-GridItem-StyledGridItem eb348if0"><div data-testid="promo" data-chromatic="ignore" class="ssrcss-1ny4qi9-Promo e1vyq2e80"><div class="ssrcss-1ugqpo7-PromoPortrait et3mn3r0"><div class="ssrcss-15tmd9i-PromoContent exn3ah912"><div spacing="2" class="ssrcss-l0lt4o-Stack e1y4nx260"><a href="/food/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251" class="ssrcss-jrq4xn-PromoLink exn3ah94"><span role="text"><p class="ssrcss-6bmydz-PromoHeadline exn3ah99"><span class="visually-hidden ssrcss-i2z2ig-VisuallyHidden e16en2lz0">Frozen elderflower posset  By Mary Berry</span><span aria-hidden="true">Frozen elderflower posset </span></p></span></a><p class="ssrcss-1q0x1qg-Paragraph e1jhz7w10"><span><span aria-hidden="true">By <!-- -->Mary Berry</span><span class="ssrcss-1tfor3h-StyledDescription eb348if6"><a href="/food/posset" aria-label="A collection of 6 more posset recipes" class="ssrcss-15td0ur-InlineLink e1kn3p7n0">posset recipes<!-- --> (<!-- -->6<!-- -->)</a></span></span></p></div></div><div class="ssrcss-z60stg-PromoImageContainer en81kx34"><div class="ssrcss-17h6w1t-PromoImageContainerInner en81kx32"><div class="ssrcss-fec6qv-ImageWrapper en81kx33"><span class="ssrcss-vu8oqf-Placeholder etlorgc0"><img alt="Frozen elderflower posset " loading="lazy" src="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251_16x9.jpg" srcSet="https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_160/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251_16x9.jpg 160w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_208/recipes/frozen_el