essert is so fragrant and so easy to make: the ingredients are just whipped together and frozen and it doesn’t need churning. Serve with summer berries for the perfect summer dessert.\",\"availabilityEnd\":\"2099-03-31T20:00:00.000Z\",\"diets\":[{\"id\":\"egg_free\"},{\"id\":\"nut_free\"},{\"id\":\"pregnancy_friendly\"},{\"id\":\"vegetarian\"}],\"isQuickAndEasy\":\"false\",\"chef\":{\"id\":\"mary_berry\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"displayName\":\"Mary Berry\"},\"relations\":{\"count\":6,\"title\":\"posset recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/posset\"},\"type\":\"dish\",\"url\":\"/food/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251\",\"image\":{\"template\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_{width}/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251_16x9.jpg\",\"aceTemplate\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/{width}/food/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251_16x9.jpg\",\"aceThumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/1600/food/recipes/frozen_elderflower_07251_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"sizes\":[160,208,320,448,608,832,1600]}},{\"course\":{\"id\":\"afternoon_tea\",\"title\":\"Cakes and baking\"},\"id\":\"lemon_and_lavender_79937\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"title\":\"Lemon and lavender posset with lavender biscuits\",\"lastModified\":\"2025-03-17T12:02:28.000Z\",\"seasons\":[],\"food\":{\"id\":\"posset\",\"title\":\"posset\"},\"description\":\"A posset is a very simple pudding that dates back to the middle ages. Some possets can be very heavy on the cream, but I’ve used lemon juice and fragrant lavender to cut the richness.\",\"availabilityEnd\":\"2099-11-11T12:00:00.000Z\",\"diets\":[{\"id\":\"egg_free\"},{\"id\":\"nut_free\"},{\"id\":\"pregnancy_friendly\"},{\"id\":\"vegetarian\"}],\"isQuickAndEasy\":\"false\",\"chef\":{\"id\":\"paul_hollywood\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"displayName\":\"Paul Hollywood\"},\"relations\":{\"count\":6,\"title\":\"posset recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/posset\"},\"type\":